  "text": {
    "action": "a volleyball player receiving a serve with a forearm pass, ball contacting the joined forearms",
    "core": "Feet wider than the shoulders and flat on the floor, knees bent about 65 degrees, hips back, trunk leaning forward so the shoulders are over the knees; both arms straight and pressed together in front of the body, hands clasped with thumbs side by side, forming one flat platform angled toward the target; ball on the forearms just above the wrists, between the waist and knee height.",
    "gaze": "Eyes on the ball at contact, chin slightly down.",
